# Secrets & disposable runtime state.
# NOTE: data/, reports/ and exports/ are deliberately NOT ignored — raw
# payloads, generated reports and the spreadsheet CSVs are committed
# (ADR-010, ADR-013). Only var/ is throwaway.
.env
var/

